In the first, create and fill a table of 3 million payments (takes about 10 seconds):
```postgresql
CREATE TABLE derive_payments (
    payment_id   bigserial PRIMARY KEY,
    merchant     text   NOT NULL,
    amount_cents bigint NOT NULL
);
INSERT INTO derive_payments (merchant, amount_cents)
SELECT 'm-' || lpad((g % 2000)::text, 4, '0'), 500 + (g::bigint * 7919) % 20000
FROM generate_series(1, 3000000) g;
VACUUM ANALYZE derive_payments;
```

